=== D-222 / class hardcoded-list-substituted-for-the-configured-source ===
  FR-034: the lane's test-file recogniser MATCHES the repo's pytest
  discovery patterns. It was a hand-written regex roster that added
  *_test.py and treated any path segment spelled `tests` as a test tree
  whatever the file inside it was. Every surplus member is SUBTRACTED
  from the lane's file and line counts, so the roster widened exactly
  the bound FR-016 / CT-006 exist to hold.

  every pyproject.toml in this repo that declares the setting:
    plugins/forge/pyproject.toml                   python_files=['test_*.py'] testpaths=['tests']
    plugins/foundry/mcp-server/pyproject.toml      python_files=['test_*.py'] testpaths=['tests']
    plugins/webster/pyproject.toml                 python_files=['test_*.py'] testpaths=['tests']
  vocab mirrors them, key for key:
    schemas/vocab.py                               PYTEST_PYTHON_FILES=['test_*.py'] PYTEST_TESTPATHS=['tests']
    equal on every declared source                 True

=== the two commits the defect drove through the lane, re-driven ===
  Each is two source files and 405 added-plus-deleted lines through a
  lane bounded at one non-test file and twenty. Both returned ok True
  and each lead_fix audit record named only the small half.

  escape 1: src/tiny.py (5 lines) + src/helpers_test.py (400 lines)
    is_test_file(src/helpers_test.py            ) False
    non-test files measured                 ['src/helpers_test.py', 'src/tiny.py']
    non-test added-plus-deleted lines       405
    lane verdict: <commit> changes 2 non-test file(s) (src/helpers_test.py, src/tiny.py) — the lane requires exactly 1. Dispatch this to a GRIND teammate instead.

  escape 2: src/tiny2.py (5 lines) + src/tests/production_helper.py (400 lines)
    is_test_file(src/tests/production_helper.py ) False
    non-test files measured                 ['src/tests/production_helper.py', 'src/tiny2.py']
    non-test added-plus-deleted lines       405
    lane verdict: <commit> changes 2 non-test file(s) (src/tests/production_helper.py, src/tiny2.py) — the lane requires exactly 1. Dispatch this to a GRIND teammate instead.

=== D-223 / class guard-narrowed-past-the-harm-it-names ===
